+"""Cine Lab · ep01 SHORTS — đo tương phản chữ TRÊN CHÍNH clip Short (cùng cách đo today/tp.py, tỉ lệ WCAG). Ô theo toạ độ khung 1080×1920.
+/opt/cine/bin/python tp.py S1|S2|S3  → in từng ô + JSON {min, ten_min}
+"""
+import io, json, subprocess, sys
+import numpy as np
+from PIL import Image
+def lin(c): c = c / 255.0; return np.where(c <= 0.03928, c / 12.92, ((c + 0.055) / 1.055) ** 2.4)
+def L(rgb): r, g, b = lin(np.array(rgb, float)); return 0.2126 * r + 0.7152 * g + 0.0722 * b
+def ratio(a, b): la, lb = L(a), L(b); return (max(la, lb) + 0.05) / (min(la, lb) + 0.05)
+BOX = {
+ 'S1': [(31.0, '"London"', (60, 310, 500, 405), 'light'), (31.0, '"Covent Garden"', (62, 440, 400, 480), 'light'), (31.0, '"clockwork timer"', (500, 990, 880, 1030), 'light'),
+        (31.0, '"every two weeks"', (520, 1065, 880, 1105), 'light'), (31.0, '"~1,100 gas lamps" (hổ phách)', (66, 1335, 460, 1372), 'light'),
+        (31.0, '"5 lamplighters"', (66, 1190, 700, 1300), 'light'), (31.0, 'nguồn British Gas', (66, 1440, 600, 1482), 'light')],
+ 'S2': [(25.0, 'số lớn "−34%"', (80, 540, 420, 650), 'dark'), (37.0, 'thẻ PROJECTION (navy)', (90, 425, 780, 482), 'light'), (37.0, 'nhãn hàng "Telephone operators"', (80, 845, 500, 885), 'dark'),
+        (37.0, 'giá trị "−21%"', (340, 1288, 452, 1330), 'dark'), (37.0, 'nhãn trục "−20%"', (440, 1346, 545, 1390), 'dark'), (37.0, 'dòng nguồn', (80, 1395, 840, 1440), 'dark'),
+        (37.0, '"same pattern" (nâu)', (80, 560, 600, 640), 'dark')],
+ 'S3': [(27.5, 'nhãn ACTUAL', (95, 520, 800, 560), 'dark'), (27.5, 'chú giải phân loại', (130, 1172, 700, 1212), 'dark'), (27.5, 'nhãn năm "1950"', (610, 1118, 710, 1158), 'dark'),
+        (27.5, 'nguồn Census', (80, 1332, 800, 1372), 'dark'), (45.0, '"1 in ~270"', (80, 1250, 560, 1322), 'dark'), (45.0, 'thẻ "Elevator operator"', (275, 1005, 640, 1050), 'dark'),
+        (45.0, 'nguồn Bessen', (80, 1347, 800, 1388), 'dark')],
+}
+n = sys.argv[1]; v = f'/var/tmp/cine-out/ep01/shorts/{n}.mkv'
+nf = int(subprocess.run(['ffprobe', '-v', 'error', '-count_packets', '-select_streams', 'v:0', '-show_entries', 'stream=nb_read_packets', '-of', 'csv=p=0', v], capture_output=True, text=True).stdout)
+boxes = BOX[n] + [((nf - 12) / 24, 'thẻ kết "full film on the channel"', (200, 1045, 760, 1090), 'light'), ((nf - 12) / 24, 'thẻ kết "Last Lamplighters"', (130, 895, 830, 965), 'light')]
+res = []
+for t, name, b, kind in boxes:
+    r = subprocess.run(['ffmpeg', '-nostdin', '-v', 'error', '-ss', f'{t:.3f}', '-i', v, '-frames:v', '1', '-f', 'image2pipe', '-vcodec', 'png', '-'], capture_output=True, check=True)
+    im = Image.open(io.BytesIO(r.stdout)).convert('RGB')
+    a = np.asarray(im.crop(b)).reshape(-1, 3).astype(int); o = np.argsort(a.sum(1)); k = len(o)
+    lo, hi = a[o[: max(1, k * 3 // 100)]], a[o[-k * 40 // 100:]]
+    if kind == 'light': lo, hi = a[o[: k * 40 // 100]], a[o[-max(1, k * 3 // 100):]]
+    fg = np.median(lo if kind == 'dark' else hi, axis=0); bg = np.median(hi if kind == 'dark' else lo, axis=0)
+    q = ratio(fg, bg); res.append(dict(t=round(t, 2), name=name, box=b, ratio=round(float(q), 2))); print(f'{t:6.2f}s  {q:5.2f}:1  {name}')
+out = {'short': n, 'min': min(x['ratio'] for x in res), 'ten_min': min(res, key=lambda x: x['ratio'])['name'], 'o': res}
+json.dump(out, open(f'/var/tmp/cine-out/ep01/shorts/{n}.tuong_phan.json', 'w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=1)
+print(json.dumps({k: out[k] for k in ('short', 'min', 'ten_min')}, ensure_ascii=False))
